# iCloud Drive conflict copies. This repository lives in iCloud, and the file provider
# resolves a two-machine conflict by writing "Forecast 2.swift" beside "Forecast.swift".
# SwiftPM does not compile them, so nothing breaks — they just get committed by anything
# that stages broadly, which is how 3,444 lines of them reached the v1.0.0 tag.
